# keel-lnmp: the socket units of mariadb-server stay off (keel-mariadb#29).
#
# mariadb.socket has ListenStream=3306, which systemd binds as [::]:3306, on
# every address of the machine, uplink included, and with it the server's
# bind-address has no effect. mariadb-extra.socket also starts the server
# with sockets from systemd. The first boot of systemd enables every unit
# that no preset disables, and pct create of Proxmox VE makes the first
# start of a container a first boot. conf.d/main also masks both.
disable mariadb.socket
disable mariadb-extra.socket
